<title>SPAIN: Spain's Aznar - May unemployment fell by 50,000.</title>
<headline>Spain's Aznar - May unemployment fell by 50,000.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish Prime Minister Jose Maria Aznar said unemployment in May had fallen by more than 50,000.</p>
<p>Unemployment in May &quot;fell by more than 50,000,&quot; Aznar told journalists in response to a question.  </p>
<p>In April, unemployment fell by 45,799 people to a rate of 13.61 percent in comparison with 13.89 percent in March.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
